  "milestones": {
    "M0": {
      "id": 19353768,
      "node_id": "MI_kwDOVoEQ6s4BJ1Co",
      "number": 1,
      "title": "M0: Qualify foundations and scope",
      "description": "Pinned tools/contracts/secure CI/native target qualification and explicit household input contract. Owner-private input can remain blocked without halting synthetic work.\n\nExit gate: CUR-001\u2013004 pass engineering checks; CUR-047 template passes and unresolved owner inputs explicitly listed. No live account prerequisite to M1.\n\n<!-- currents-plan:2026-11-09; milestone:M0 -->",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/shaug/currents/milestone/1"
    },
    "M1": {
      "id": 19353769,
      "node_id": "MI_kwDOVoEQ6s4BJ1Cp",
      "number": 2,
      "title": "M1: Prove encrypted synthetic slice",
      "description": "Three separately qualified storage seams, ordered authority, exact accounting, commands/replay and bounded import/recognition.\n\nExit gate: CUR-005\u2013014 pass on Mac arm64/Linux x86_64 including encrypted1,200-op/fault/status and exact canonical replay. Synthetic-only developer preview; not MVP.\n\n<!-- currents-plan:2026-11-09; milestone:M1 -->",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/shaug/currents/milestone/2"
    },
    "M2": {
      "id": 19353770,
      "node_id": "MI_kwDOVoEQ6s4BJ1Cq",
      "number": 3,
      "title": "M2: Complete financial semantics",
      "description": "Associations/corrections/reconciliation, present positions/organization/history, investments/FX/loans/manual and complete forecasts.\n\nExit gate: CUR-015\u2013028 pass all financial counterexamples and S1\u2013S10 engine fixtures; no financial scope postponed beyond usable MVP.\n\n<!-- currents-plan:2026-11-09; milestone:M2 -->",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/shaug/currents/milestone/3"
    },
    "M3": {
      "id": 19353771,
      "node_id": "MI_kwDOVoEQ6s4BJ1Cr",
      "number": 4,
      "title": "M3: Protect and recover private records",
      "description": "Portable archives, snapshots, generation activation, keys/locking, backup/retention and privacy checks.\n\nExit gate: CUR-029\u2013033 and049 pass full-replay/offline lost-device/hostile-input/fault tests with real-data gate still off until signed host and owner setup.\n\n<!-- currents-plan:2026-11-09; milestone:M3 -->",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/shaug/currents/milestone/4"
    },
    "M4": {
      "id": 19353772,
      "node_id": "MI_kwDOVoEQ6s4BJ1Cs",
      "number": 5,
      "title": "M4: Ship coherent native clients",
      "description": "Persistent FFI, XPC, owner authority, complete Mac UX, CLI/offline reader and restricted optional MCP.\n\nExit gate: CUR-034\u2013040 and056 pass parity/accessibility/retry/scope tests on qualified platforms; signed trust certification finishes in M6. No web shell or independent client math.\n\n<!-- currents-plan:2026-11-09; milestone:M4 -->",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/shaug/currents/milestone/5"
    },
    "M5": {
      "id": 19353773,
      "node_id": "MI_kwDOVoEQ6s4BJ1Ct",
      "number": 6,
      "title": "M5: Qualify household acquisition",
      "description": "Read-only refresh/provider coverage, Apple entitlement/mobile evidence and owner-private activation.\n\nExit gate: CUR-041\u2013046,048,057,058 pass per-account coverage/consent/recovery gates or permitted owner-accepted limitations recorded. Missing Apple/provider feasibility remains visible release blocker.\n\n<!-- currents-plan:2026-11-09; milestone:M5 -->",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/shaug/currents/milestone/6"
    },
    "M6": {
      "id": 19353775,
      "node_id": "MI_kwDOVoEQ6s4BJ1Cv",
      "number": 7,
      "title": "M6: Qualify complete household release",
      "description": "Deep properties/faults, performance, docs, SBOM/provenance, signed distribution and all journey acceptance.\n\nExit gate: CUR-050\u2013055 pass exact candidate commit; S1\u2013S12 and every inventory component/forecast horizon/protection gate satisfied. Explicit owner release approval still required before publication.\n\n<!-- currents-plan:2026-11-09; milestone:M6 -->",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/shaug/currents/milestone/7"
    }
  },
